@WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5201

### Create user
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "bob", "password": "1234" }

### Create post
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hi", "body": "Text", "userId": 1 }

### Get all posts
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/posts